# Scope discipline

- Change only what the task requires. No drive-by cleanups, renames, or rewrites in unrelated files.
- Do not edit markdown files the user did not ask for (agent scaffolding docs are an exception when that is the task).
- One specialist owns a change set; do not mix Experience + Performance + Platform edits on the same hot files without sequencing.
- Match existing naming, types, and abstraction level in the surrounding code.
